{"id": "EUVD-2026-104277", "enisaUuid": "d77f2879-b67b-34dd-aad9-b3d469b8215d", "description": "FlyCms through commit edfdf724 contains a default credentials vulnerability that allows unauthenticated remote attackers to gain super administrator access via the flycms account with password admin123. Attackers can log in through POST /api/auth/login, solving only the image captcha, to obtain full control of site content, users and configuration.", "datePublished": "2026-10-19T13:55:36", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-19T14:12:56", "baseScore": 9.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:N/VC:H/VI:H/VA:H/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/sunkaifei/FlyCms/issues/19", "https://github.com/sunkaifei/FlyCms/blob/edfdf724c3b944310f60c29aa755d03a00a75837/sql/flycms_20260928_093335.sql", "https://github.com/sunkaifei/FlyCms/blob/edfdf724c3b944310f60c29aa755d03a00a75837/README.md", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/flycms-through-commit-edfdf724-default-super-administrator-credentials"], "aliases": ["GHSA-6phq-6cxr-q574", "CVE-2026-112296"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.42, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "d3ff8d9e-1b40-39d2-9108-7c60ee849dd7", "product": {"name": "FlyCMS", "vendor": {"name": "sunkaifei"}}, "product_version": "0 \u2264edfdf724c3b944310f60c29aa755d03a00a75837"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "29d31d52-ac51-3fb8-bb3d-8d4ee81f6273", "vendor": {"name": "sunkaifei"}}], "isExploited": false}